In youth the days are short and the years are long. In old age the years ar=
e short and day's long.=0A=
<br>=0A=
An idea that is not dangerous is unworthy of being called an idea at all.=
=0A=
<br>=0A=
You spend all your life trying to do something they put people in asylums f=
or.=0A=
<br>=0A=
The lie is a condition of life.=0A=
<br>=0A=
If you want something done, ask a busy person to do it. The more things you=
 do, the more you can do.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Absence blots people out. We really have no absent friends.=0A=
<br>=0A=
The mind can weave itself warmly in the cocoon of its own thoughts, and dwe=
ll a hermit anywhere.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Fan the sinking flame of hilarity with the wing of friendship and pass the =
rosy wine.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Rides in the whirlwind and directs the storm.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Whoever slaps you on your right cheek, turn to him the other also. [Matthew=
 5:39]=0A=
<br>=0A=
Harsh necessity, and the newness of my kingdom, force me to do such things =
and to guard my frontiers everywhere.=0A=
<br>=0A=
An aim in life is the only fortune worth finding.=0A=
<br>=0A=
If there was no moral evil upon earth, there would be no physical evil.=0A=
